__pycache__/
.venv/
*.pyc

# One JSON file per eval run — the lab's only durable artifact besides the
# ledger. The index, the retrieved contexts and the answers live in process
# memory and are discarded with it. Reproducible from the fixtures,
# machine-specific, appended to on every sweep.
.runs/
# `.screens/` is deliberately NOT ignored. A judge screen is the evidence for
# which model was allowed to grade the four deciding metrics, so it is part of
# the argument rather than an artifact of a machine — and the one thing this
# project has already lost to a wiped scratch directory.

# Datasets imported through the panel. The four bundled samples in
# fixtures/groundtruth_datasets/ are part of the repository — they are reference
# points, and the argument for a finding being general rather than true of Farsi
# diaries. A corpus somebody uploaded is their material, not this repository's.
.datasets/

# The experiment ledger. Machine-local history, not source.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
.claude
.docs
